{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0246.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0246", "text": "‘Nothing, it’s nothing. It’s only a pebble.’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0279.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0279", "text": "‘Yes – no. Well, it was in somebody’s house.’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0299.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0299", "text": "‘Oh, yes. Well – a bit. He was a pilot, once. He was in the Battle of Britain. I’ve got...’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0368.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0368", "text": "‘I think... I don’t know. I think it’s free.’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0861.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0861", "text": "‘Nothing. I don’t want to touch one, that’s all.’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0876.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0876", "text": "‘You might damage it. If they’re valuable you’ll get into trouble, won't you?’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0487.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0487", "text": "‘What are you going back into the house for? I’ve seen all the house, haven’t I?’", "voice": "Charles_wary_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0922.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0922", "text": "‘It’s O.K. I just got locked in. Goodnight,’ and raced for the stairs, before the questions could begin.", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0853.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0853", "text": "‘I – I can see them all right, can’t I?’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1"}
